{"2525410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Vacancy Tonight", "steam_appid": 2525410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/29a47567e0276b13a62e99800986ff2b.webp?t=1784305433\" width=601 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in the heart of the desert, Motel 86 is the perfect stop for travelers seeking peace and seclusion, a place so isolated that no one will hear if you call for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/592c191a3c3cae26519091b0f536a8fb.poster.avif?t=1784305433\" width=780 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/592c191a3c3cae26519091b0f536a8fb.webm?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/592c191a3c3cae26519091b0f536a8fb.mp4?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1c06bbb1540e56b977ae98bce421945e.webp?t=1784305433\" width=601 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up locked in a room. Somehow, you manage to get out… and a phone starts ringing somewhere in the distance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Who’s calling? Why are you here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Vacancy Tonight is a first-person mystery adventure in 3D, point-and-click style, with a touch of psychological horror. The motel looks frozen in time, perfectly preserved, but its silence feels off. Explore endless hallways, deserted rooms, forgotten offices, and a 1960s diner while collecting items, solving puzzles, and uncovering the dark secrets hidden within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1a4b2a86b05705a2b913fb63ca0ee759.poster.avif?t=1784305433\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1a4b2a86b05705a2b913fb63ca0ee759.webm?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1a4b2a86b05705a2b913fb63ca0ee759.mp4?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/23e842c48d33c4220eb7787d2269e05e.webp?t=1784305433\" width=601 height=61 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:</strong> The motel isn’t safe. The deeper you go, the less alone you’ll feel. This game is crafted for those who crave mystery and tension, but also value the freedom to explore every corner at their own pace, without the constant pressure and urgency of traditional survival horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration: </strong>Roam freely and discover hidden areas as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted puzzles: </strong>Puzzles are scattered everywhere, as if someone wanted you to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/e8d5b7de544b74e6000982492ee1669b.poster.avif?t=1784305433\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/e8d5b7de544b74e6000982492ee1669b.webm?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/e8d5b7de544b74e6000982492ee1669b.mp4?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/29a47567e0276b13a62e99800986ff2b.webp?t=1784305433\" width=601 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in the heart of the desert, Motel 86 is the perfect stop for travelers seeking peace and seclusion, a place so isolated that no one will hear if you call for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/592c191a3c3cae26519091b0f536a8fb.poster.avif?t=1784305433\" width=780 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/592c191a3c3cae26519091b0f536a8fb.webm?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/592c191a3c3cae26519091b0f536a8fb.mp4?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1c06bbb1540e56b977ae98bce421945e.webp?t=1784305433\" width=601 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up locked in a room. Somehow, you manage to get out… and a phone starts ringing somewhere in the distance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Who’s calling? Why are you here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Vacancy Tonight is a first-person mystery adventure in 3D, point-and-click style, with a touch of psychological horror. The motel looks frozen in time, perfectly preserved, but its silence feels off. Explore endless hallways, deserted rooms, forgotten offices, and a 1960s diner while collecting items, solving puzzles, and uncovering the dark secrets hidden within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1a4b2a86b05705a2b913fb63ca0ee759.poster.avif?t=1784305433\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1a4b2a86b05705a2b913fb63ca0ee759.webm?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/1a4b2a86b05705a2b913fb63ca0ee759.mp4?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/23e842c48d33c4220eb7787d2269e05e.webp?t=1784305433\" width=601 height=61 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:</strong> The motel isn’t safe. The deeper you go, the less alone you’ll feel. This game is crafted for those who crave mystery and tension, but also value the freedom to explore every corner at their own pace, without the constant pressure and urgency of traditional survival horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration: </strong>Roam freely and discover hidden areas as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted puzzles: </strong>Puzzles are scattered everywhere, as if someone wanted you to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/e8d5b7de544b74e6000982492ee1669b.poster.avif?t=1784305433\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/e8d5b7de544b74e6000982492ee1669b.webm?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/extras/e8d5b7de544b74e6000982492ee1669b.mp4?t=1784305433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Imagine waking up trapped in an abandoned motel. When you manage to get out of the room, a phone rings in the distance... In this point &amp; click adventure game in 3D, you will have to use your wit to solve puzzles and find out what happened.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Catalan, Russian, Basque, German, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/58b6eb2645889d87456915a502e05c65d63283ad/header.jpg?t=1784305433", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525410/2b